'' span( of T )( p, n ) (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003 §5): TKO1073 for a pointer to another type and
'' for a missing count; TKO1052 for a pointer to const T made a mutable span. An 'any ptr' is
'' taken, and 'span( of const T )' takes a pointer to const T.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/array-slice-ctor.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slice-ctor.tiko(6,32): error TKO1073: span( of integer )( p, n ) needs a pointer to integer and a count
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slice-ctor.tiko(7,32): error TKO1073
'' EXPECT-OUT: array-slice-ctor.tiko(8,52): error TKO1052: a const span( of integer ) cannot convert to a mutable span( of integer )
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 3
